WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
The next generation of internet. Not a new website. A new way to use one.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Bring a document or a video. Ursly reads it, and answers only from it.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
Voice to action. Say it, and Ursly does it. Motion works in beta.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
Motion to action. In beta, built for the headsets coming next.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
Every way in stays open. Keyboard is complete. Brain is a research beta.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
One continuous lifecycle. Smaller loops at every stage, from canary release to learning.
